  "body": "Apple Silicon (arm64) build for macOS 26 or later. The app is not signed with an Apple Developer ID and not notarized: after downloading, open it once from System Settings › Privacy & Security. Installed copies of 0.4.0 or later update themselves.\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(r2-guard): 持久化两个桶的停用待办 by @JUNERDD in https://github.com/JUNERDD/Atd/pull/51\n* keep privacy grants across updates, and resume the welcome guide in place by @JUNERDD in https://github.com/JUNERDD/Atd/pull/52\n* release 0.7.12 by @JUNERDD in https://github.com/JUNERDD/Atd/pull/53\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JUNERDD/Atd/compare/v0.7.11...v0.7.12",
